# r1113 chunk 3, boot A1 of 3 on one server (then c3_a2.qb, c3_a3.qb on the same OUT). Group A superflat
# (ground top y -61, stand at y -60), full pack.
# Server: bash tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh OUT c3a1 A difficulty=normal
#   prep_srv swaps in the build/libs jars newer than mods/ (on 2026-11-13: Common, Compat, Brewing, Calendar 11-12,
#   Delight 11-11, Engineering, Devtools 11-10 late); NOSWAP=1 tests the installed jars instead. Every c3_* server
#   (prep_srv, cc_only_srv, cpp_chain_srv) does the same swap. perfBot is added by prep_srv.
# Before boot: copy tools/scratch_query/c3_probe.js, zp_probe.js, zact_probe.js into OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/ as
#   zz_c3_probe.js, zz_zp_probe.js, zz_zact_probe.js (zq is copied by prep_srv). No config edit for this boot.
# Order matters: kjsexpect rows (SQ-BOT-01) before the first /reload; SQ-CCB-01 and SQ-DCM-02 (/reload) are last.
# Rows written from feature_writeup/testing/scratch_queue.md 2026-11-13; ids moved since the rows were written are
# fixed here (c3_triage.md lists them). Bots: G (farming, cooking), pg (Portal Gun flag pairs, stays online to the
# stop: c3_a2.qb re-reads its portals), qa (gun despawn rows), qm (mirror walls), qn (Nether frame).
# Not here: SQ-PG-01 old-jar portals (no pre-11-07 Compat jar kept), SQ-IP-04 death-and-respawn case (perfBot respawn
#   untested), SQ-ENGM-04 Ore Excavation half (needs the client key).
pace 1

## SQ-C3A-setup | area, gamerules, bots (not a test row)
> forceload add 1000 1000 1480 1080
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule doFireTick false
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> time set noon
> weather clear
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> pbot spawn G 1000 -60 1000 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot spawn pg 1300 -60 1030 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot spawn qa 1350 -60 1030 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot spawn qm 1200 -60 1065 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 5
> zc3 bstate 1000 -61 1000
expect \[c3\] bstate 1000 -61 1000 Block\{minecraft:grass_block\}
reject \[c3\] error
look setup; four bots spawned; zc3 answers (probe loaded)

## SQ-BOT-01 | [botany_pots] growthTicks scaled line, no scaleRecipeInt missing
kjsexpect \[botany_pots\] growthTicks scaled on \d+ pot crops \(\d+ flowers x2, the rest x8\); pot fertilizers removed
kjsreject scaleRecipeInt missing
shell grep -h "\[botany_pots\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200
look count near 173 (the 11-12 pack log says 175 crops, 49 flowers)

## SQ-DCM-01 | startup packs in order start with creativecommon, all Common files loaded, no ReferenceError
shell grep -h "startup script packs in order" logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-300
shell grep -qE "startup script packs in order: creativecommon," logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell grep -qE "\[jar-startup\] creativecommon: ([0-9]+) of \1 files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell test "$(grep -cE "ReferenceError|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log)" = 0
# row text said "18 of 18": Common has 22 files since the 11-07 to 11-12 builds; the check is N of N

## SQ-CMV-01 | no tested-range WARN, no Common mixin apply error, all Common startup files loaded
bootreject outside the tested range
bootreject Mixin apply.*creativecommon|creativecommon\.mixins\.json.*(fail|error)
shell grep -qE "\[jar-startup\] creativecommon: ([0-9]+) of \1 files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log

## SQ-PA-01 | [paintings] N of N modded variants built, no WARN, no Couldn't load painting
bootexpect \[paintings\] (\d+) of \1 modded painting variants built from \d+ sources
bootreject WARN.*\[paintings\]
bootreject Couldn't load painting
shell grep -h "\[paintings\]" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-250 | head -5
look count was 445 when the row was written; another number is fine if it is N of N

## SQ-BPT-01 | dedicated server: no [banner_patterns] line, no Compat mixin error
bootreject \[banner_patterns\]
bootreject creativecompat\.mixins\.json.*(fail|error)|Mixin apply failed.*creativecompat

## SQ-T1-01 | no event errors; Gelatin and Empty Terrarium ids exist (names are a client check)
bootreject Error occurred while handling event
> zq item hostiledelight:refinedgelatin
> zq item redeco:jar
waitlog \[zq\] item redeco:jar 20
reject \[zq\] error
