## SQ-MG-22 | coffee bush on basalt removed by its tick, coffee items or nothing dropped, wheat untouched
bootreject CoffeeBushRemovedMixin.*(fail|error|Exception)
> fill 1000 -61 1040 1004 -61 1040 minecraft:basalt
> setblock 1002 -60 1040 farmersrespite:coffee_bush[half=lower]
> setblock 1002 -59 1040 farmersrespite:coffee_bush_top
> setblock 1004 -61 1041 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock 1004 -60 1041 minecraft:wheat[age=3]
> zc3 bstate 1002 -60 1040 1002 -59 1040
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 300
sleep 10
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> zc3 bstate 1002 -60 1040 1002 -59 1040 1004 -60 1041
> zc3 items 1002 -60 1040 4
expect bstate 1002 -60 1040 Block\{minecraft:air\}
expect bstate 1004 -60 1041 Block\{minecraft:wheat\}
reject bstate .*wither
look first bstate shows the bush placed (if `coffee_bush_top` is not the upper block id, the upper half failed: the lower half is the test); items: Rustic Delight coffee items or none; no Wither Roots

